        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1038"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts467" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts471">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>and on the right also a pipe with a bend.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1039"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts473" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts481">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then at the top of a, I thought it looked like a book, a kind of slanted book which is planted obliquely in that head.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
