        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1049"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts607" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts609">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>With a round nose in the middle.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a1050"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts611" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts613">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And then sort of, or sort of, not sort of a rod through that nose.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
